# Root .gitignore for the TrendyFits monorepo.
# There was none before 2026-10-01, which is how sick-fits/node_modules and a
# 60 MB set of Node installers ended up tracked. Patterns here are repo-wide.

# --- Node toolchain installers: NEVER commit these ---
# (Day 9 cleanup, 2026-10-01: sick-fits/backend had node-v20.18.0-x64.msi,
#  node-v22.12.0-x64.msi and nvm-setup.exe committed, 60.14 MB of the 62.58 MB tree)
*.msi
*.exe
nvm-setup*
node-v*-x64.msi

# --- Dependencies ---
# The per-package .gitignore files cover their own node_modules/, but nothing
# covered sick-fits/node_modules/ — so sick-fits/node_modules/.package-lock.json
# was committed. This root pattern closes that gap.
node_modules/

# --- OS / editor noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Logs ---
*.log
